<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="Basa Jawa Offline — Kamus Indonesia-Jawa & Jawa-Inggris. Tanpa internet.">
<title>Basa Jawa Offline — Kamus</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f6f1e7; --card: #ffffff; --ink: #2c2c2c; --muted: #777;
    --accent: #7c4a1e; --accent2: #4a2c12; --border: #ddd; --chip: #e8dcc8;
